## Approval

```bash
make restore-pve2 EXTRA="-e allow_restore_pve2=true \
  -e restore_confirmation_pve2='{{ restore_confirmation_pve2_required }}'"
```

## Rollback

Nothing here deletes an archive. If a restore produces a broken guest, destroy the
restored guest only (`qm destroy <target_vmid>`), fix the plan, and restore again
from the same untouched archive.
